# tally 2.1.8 (item 12 of the third turn, pick P33; group 2's fix, N7): pre falls on 2024-12-21, before S, so it
# is left out; its amount is known from 2025-01-01. Every instance reads its amounts at its booking cut min(t, K)
# (E §4.1 step 2; L §4.3, §4.5, §5.14.3), a left-out one too, and no later version answers a booking that books
# nothing: q is the hole. ceca866c printed 40.00 DUK, the amount at K. inn, inside the run, is answered by late2
# from 2025-02-01 (E §5 step 1): q2 is 30.00 DUK on either commit.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2025-03-10
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2025-06-30

source s "s"
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
place bank: accounts DUK lives 2024-01-01..
place out: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money DUK
input d: date
input amt3: money DUK
input d2: date

move pre: transfers
  on d
  leg cash from bank to out amount amt

move inn: transfers
  on d2
  leg cash from bank to out amount amt3

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2024-11-01
  d = 2024-12-21 "s"
  d2 = 2025-01-05 "s"

version late
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  amt = 40.00 DUK "s"

version late2
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-02-01
  amt3 = 30.00 DUK "s"

ask q: m.cash.amount for m in transfers over 2024-12-01 .. 2024-12-31
ask q2: m.cash.amount for m in transfers over 2025-01-01 .. 2025-01-31
=== expect
q (m = pre): ?"amt: no value" (amt)
  cut 2025-03-10
q2 (m = inn): 30.00 DUK
  unfulfilled: inn
  cut 2025-03-10
